cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite both the dataset DOI and the article that describes it."
type: dataset
title: "A nine-class UAV dataset of Solidago canadensis, Daishan Island, Zhoushan, China"
abstract: >-
  7,209 manually annotated 256x256 UAV tiles (ground sampling distance 3.4 cm,
  acquired 25 October 2025) of a rural-urban fringe on Daishan Island, Zhoushan,
  Zhejiang, China, labelled with nine classes centred on the invasive perennial
  Solidago canadensis L. Tiles are split 5,046 / 1,442 / 721 by spatially contiguous
  blocks so that no training tile is adjacent to a test tile.
